  "details": "In the unity editor it renders fine, although in vrchat itself the probes are only reflecting the light sources in the world. But here's the really odd part: If you resize the vrchat application window just by a tiny bit by pulling any corner or side of the window, the reflections suddenly work as intended! I'm not quite sure why this is the case.",
